<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Heredoc on {code that works}</title><link>https://sadique.io/tags/heredoc/</link><description>Recent content in Heredoc on {code that works}</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><copyright>© 2008-2025 Sadique Ali.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Jul 2012 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sadique.io/tags/heredoc/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Heredocs in Ruby and Python</title><link>https://sadique.io/blog/2012/07/04/heredocs-in-ruby-and-python/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Jul 2012 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://sadique.io/blog/2012/07/04/heredocs-in-ruby-and-python/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;I have been doing some coding in Python recently. While playing around with some code, I noticed that the way &lt;a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Here_document"&gt;heredocs&lt;/a&gt; are used in Python is different from Ruby.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="python"&gt;Python&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consider the following snippet:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#586e75;background-color:#eee8d5;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#93a1a1;font-style:italic"&gt;# test.py&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#cb4b16"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#2aa198"&gt;&amp;#34;some text in single line&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#cb4b16"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#2aa198"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#2aa198"&gt;As opposed to
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#2aa198"&gt;some text
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#2aa198"&gt;written as
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#2aa198"&gt;heredoc
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#2aa198"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#cb4b16"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#2aa198"&gt;&amp;#34;and then another single line&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;When run, this would result in this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#586e75;background-color:#eee8d5;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;bash-3.2$ python test.py
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;some text in single line
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;As opposed to
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;some text
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;written as
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;heredoc
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;and &lt;span style="color:#859900"&gt;then&lt;/span&gt; another single line
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Notice how there is a preceding and trailing linebreak around the string printed using heredoc.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>